POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tax/returns/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "tax_type": "paye",
  "tax_year": 2026,
  "month": 5
}


### 6. Get Single Tax Return
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tax/returns/{{returnId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 7. Preview Tax Return
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tax/returns/{{returnId}}/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


