PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tax/returns/{{returnId}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "gra_reference": "GRA-2026-123456"
}


### 9. Submit Tax Return (no reference)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tax/returns/{{returnId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


