### GROUP 22: REPORTS & EXPORT
### 1. Get Financial Summary (current month)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Get Financial Summary (last week)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/summary?period=week
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Get Financial Summary (custom date range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/summary?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-05-31
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Export Data (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/export?format=json&date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-05-31
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Export Data (PDF — stub, requires S3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/export?format=pdf&date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-05-31
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Get Income Statement (default 6 months)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/income-statement
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Get Income Statement (3 months)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/income-statement?months=3
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Get Tax History (all available years)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/tax-history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Get Tax History (specific range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/tax-history?year_from=2025&year_to=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}








### GROUP 23: REFERRAL OFFERS
### 1. Get referral offers (all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Get referral offers (filtered by type)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals?offer_type=loan&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Check eligibility for referral offers
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals/check-eligibility
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Mark offer as viewed
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals/{{referralId}}/viewed
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Mark offer as clicked (get deep link)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals/{{referralId}}/clicked
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Dismiss offer
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals/{{referralId}}/dismiss
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Mark offer as converted (partner webhook)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals/{{referralId}}/converted
Content-Type: application/json
X-Partner-Api-Key: {{partnerApiKey}}

{
  "partner_reference": "PARTNER-REF-001",
  "converted_at": "2026-06-05T10:00:00",
  "product_name": "Quick Loan GHS 5000",
  "amount": 5000.00
}









### GROUP 24: NOTIFICATIONS
### 1. Register FCM token (Android)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "fcm_token": "fcm-token-sample-android-abc123",
  "device_info": "Samsung Galaxy S23",
  "platform": "android"
}

### 2. Register FCM token (iOS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "fcm_token": "fcm-token-sample-ios-xyz789",
  "device_info": "iPhone 15",
  "platform": "ios"
}

### 3. Unregister FCM token
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "fcm_token": "fcm-token-sample-android-abc123"
}

### 4. Get all notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Get unread notification count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Get single notification
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Mark notification as read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Mark all notifications as read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Delete a notification
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Clear all notifications
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. Get notification preferences
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. Update notification preferences (all on)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/preferences
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "deadline_reminders": true,
  "penalty_alerts": true,
  "vault_suggestions": true,
  "referral_offers": true,
  "payment_confirmations": true,
  "system_updates": true
}

### 13. Update notification preferences (partial update)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/preferences
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "vault_suggestions": false,
  "referral_offers": false
}









