### GROUP 26: ADMIN

### 1. Get all users (no filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Get users (filtered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?subscription_tier=FREE&is_active=true&date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-06-30&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Get single user detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Deactivate user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Suspected fraudulent activity"
}

### 5. Activate user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Change user role to admin
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "admin"
}

### 7. Change user role back to user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "user"
}

### 8. Get platform stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Get admin audit log (all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit-log?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Get admin audit log (filtered by user and action)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit-log?user_id={{userId}}&action=LOGIN&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. Get admin audit log (filtered by date range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit-log?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-06-30&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. Get all partners
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/partners
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 13. Create partner
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/partners
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fido Finance",
  "offer_type": "loan",
  "eligibility_threshold": {
    "min_months_data": 3,
    "min_average_income": 1500.00,
    "min_consistency_score": 70,
    "requires_tax_compliance": true
  }
}

### 14. Update partner
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/partners/{{partnerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eligibility_threshold": {
    "min_months_data": 6,
    "min_average_income": 2000.00,
    "min_consistency_score": 75,
    "requires_tax_compliance": true
  },
  "is_active": true
}

### 15. Deactivate partner (delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/partners/{{partnerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 16. Get tax rates (admin view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tax-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17. Update tax rates
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tax-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tax_year": 2026,
  "vat_standard_rate": 15.0,
  "vat_nhil_levy": 2.5,
  "vat_getfund_levy": 2.5,
  "vat_registration_threshold": 750000.00
}

